{"1639380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "StarHaulers", "steam_appid": 1639380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/595f618db2fb88b497a82065f1696a76.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/595f618db2fb88b497a82065f1696a76.avif?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=722 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where humanity has united to form the new Concordia, aliens and intelligent beings from other planets have come to see humanity as a threat. The Custodian, Concordia's governing body, has made a decision: &quot;The universe will cease to be called the universe and will instead be called Concordia.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special team has been formed: the Star Haulers, unsung heroes who fight for the pacification and stability of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Star Haulers, abandoning everything you know to fight for the cause, to fight for Concordia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/6c8cfced2af06697b3fadb3d5f740335.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/6c8cfced2af06697b3fadb3d5f740335.webp?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use physics to stay airborne and take advantage of strategic opportunities to attack enemies from behind, position yourself in high places, or dodge projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/ddb5fb0149b41b4eaa671394c984febc.poster.avif?t=1788116849\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/ddb5fb0149b41b4eaa671394c984febc.webm?t=1788116849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/ddb5fb0149b41b4eaa671394c984febc.mp4?t=1788116849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/e90365cc5bb1df1d6f4f365f4f9ba273.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/e90365cc5bb1df1d6f4f365f4f9ba273.webp?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientists have developed a variety of unique weapons so that our Star Hauler can pacify the universe as they see fit. Unlock them all and find a weapon to suit your needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/2c8a4bb868f4f9687a111064e9f53013.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/2c8a4bb868f4f9687a111064e9f53013.webp?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=685 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/616b63c24043e5e99146963fdf2a5768.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/616b63c24043e5e99146963fdf2a5768.webp?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Star Haulers are not alone on the planets of the universe. Concordia watches over them and protects them. You can equip yourself with abilities to call for backup from base with orbital strikes, healing packs, secondary weapons, shields, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/7978d510c1565e75af928992101c3ed3.poster.avif?t=1788116849\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/7978d510c1565e75af928992101c3ed3.webm?t=1788116849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/7978d510c1565e75af928992101c3ed3.mp4?t=1788116849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/f3220809434bd1c6032d351925b44bb2.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/f3220809434bd1c6032d351925b44bb2.webp?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Challenge Levels:</strong> Not all of our Star Haulers are willing to risk their lives with the same intensity. We have five difficulty levels in the missions we undertake, although dying for Concordia is one of the greatest honors you can receive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/6097644152a82654fffe73ecfab11307.avif?t=1788116849\" width=1080 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/2009147daafbec5f6b63ad30ac161181.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/2009147daafbec5f6b63ad30ac161181.webp?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperate with Your Comrades:</strong> You can go it alone to pacify the universe or with three other friends who will make the experience more manageable. It's better for the enemies to have a variety of targets to shoot at than for you to be the only target—think about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/8eca12634fa24c9dfaf06d50b5a232ca.poster.avif?t=1788116849\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/8eca12634fa24c9dfaf06d50b5a232ca.webm?t=1788116849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/8eca12634fa24c9dfaf06d50b5a232ca.mp4?t=1788116849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/8e7d375b1345be719105da002a38bd0f.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/8e7d375b1345be719105da002a38bd0f.webp?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Objectives:</strong> During the mission, you will have different objectives: withstand waves of natives, assemble the ship that will return you to base after pacifying the planet, find and destroy a specific native, and more. Your commander will inform you of your objectives upon landing.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/595f618db2fb88b497a82065f1696a76.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/595f618db2fb88b497a82065f1696a76.avif?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=722 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where humanity has united to form the new Concordia, aliens and intelligent beings from other planets have come to see humanity as a threat. The Custodian, Concordia's governing body, has made a decision: &quot;The universe will cease to be called the universe and will instead be called Concordia.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special team has been formed: the Star Haulers, unsung heroes who fight for the pacification and stability of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Star Haulers, abandoning everything you know to fight for the cause, to fight for Concordia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/6c8cfced2af06697b3fadb3d5f740335.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/6c8cfced2af06697b3fadb3d5f740335.webp?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use physics to stay airborne and take advantage of strategic opportunities to attack enemies from behind, position yourself in high places, or dodge projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/ddb5fb0149b41b4eaa671394c984febc.poster.avif?t=1788116849\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/ddb5fb0149b41b4eaa671394c984febc.webm?t=1788116849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/ddb5fb0149b41b4eaa671394c984febc.mp4?t=1788116849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/e90365cc5bb1df1d6f4f365f4f9ba273.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/e90365cc5bb1df1d6f4f365f4f9ba273.webp?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientists have developed a variety of unique weapons so that our Star Hauler can pacify the universe as they see fit. Unlock them all and find a weapon to suit your needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/2c8a4bb868f4f9687a111064e9f53013.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/2c8a4bb868f4f9687a111064e9f53013.webp?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=685 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras/616b63c24043e5e99146963fdf2a5768.avif?t=1788116849\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1639380/extras_big/616b63c24043e5e99146963fdf2a5768.webp?t=1788116849 width=1560 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Star Haulers are not alone on the planets of the universe. Concordia watches over them and protect